    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d144">

                <pb facs="0263" n="157" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg157"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of Chile to President
                    Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <hi rendition="#italic"><date
                                calendar="gregorian" when="1906-08-23">August 23,
                        1906</date>.</hi></dateline></opener>
                <p>The heartfelt expressions of condolence which you have deigned to reiterate have
                    touched the Chilean heart in a grateful and profound manner. It will never
                    forget that in this hour of ordeal it had at its side the great nation you so
                    nobly represent.</p>
                <p>Again I thank you most cordially.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jerman Riesco.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
